THIRD-PARTY / VENDOR NOTES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The apps here are clean-room rewrites. They are written against the public
Android framework only and vendor no third-party code, with one exception:

  RNNoise (apps/com.ripostelabs.projection/jni/rnnoise), the Projection app's
  microphone noise suppressor, and its "little" model weights.
  Copyright (c) 2007-2017, 2024 Jean-Marc Valin; (c) 2023 Amazon;
  (c) 2017 Mozilla; (c) 2005-2017 Xiph.Org Foundation; (c) 2003-2004 Mark Borgerding.
  BSD 3-Clause; full text in jni/rnnoise/COPYING and, in the APK,
  res/raw/rnnoise_copying.txt.

Some app directories keep an OEM-derived Java package name (for example
com.szchoiceway.photoreader inside com.ripostelabs.photos) as an artifact of the
package each rewrite replaces. The installed application IDs are all
com.ripostelabs.*; no vendor package name is claimed by any manifest.

Extracted OEM display strings were used as a reference so that typo fixes read as
direct diffs. No vendor code, resources, firmware or decompiled sources are
redistributed in this repository; apks/ and decompiled/ are git-ignored working
directories populated from the user's own device.

